	)
	(text "BQ25570 programming (see datasheet SLUSBH2G eqs 1-5):\nR1/R2 -> VBAT_OV ~5.23V (supercap overvoltage cutoff)\nR3/R4/R5 -> VBAT_OK falls 3.64V / rises 4.06V (auto load gate)\nR6/R7 -> VOUT ~3.31V regulated system rail\nVOC_SAMP tied to VSTOR = 80% MPPT for solar"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100 200 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "733ad844-2102-4097-be16-718170ea698e")
	)
	(text "SC1: single-cell supercapacitor,\n>=100uF equiv, 5.5V rated.\nFootprint per chosen part."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60 185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "77c16b00-ed05-4c38-b573-9d4f62ad8601")
	)
	(text "PF1-PF5: ERC power-source markers for nets fed by an\nexternal/passive element ERC cannot verify (solar panel,\nsupercap, regulated rail, load-switched rail) - not real parts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 230 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8efb67ff-fa98-456c-bca1-ac8fff859b9f")
	)
	(text "J3: capacitive probe plates\n(placeholder - real \"connector\" is a\ncopper-pour comb pattern laid out\non the PCB itself, not an off-board\nconnector). RA=R12, RB=R13+RV1\n(trim pot) - tune once probe C is\ncharacterized; use ESP32-C3 PCNT\nperipheral to count FREQ_IN edges."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 460 220 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a1dfdacb-d286-4ef4-a90a-925acc3db210")
	)
